      people already have in Teams, if they have one. Files are not moved, and
      thread replies become ordinary messages in time order. Everyone in a group
      conversation will see all of its history, including anyone who joined it
      late: the export does not say when a person joined.
      └ Tell the people concerned before you start. To leave direct messages
        out, set target.directMessages.enabled to false.

